<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Geupec downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Geupec downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said analyst Enrique Klix downgraded Grupo Embotelladoras Unidas SA de CV to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said in a research report that the downgrade was due to the strong rise in the stock's price.</p>
